    "vs_reference_arm": "the reference arm is the untouched host; this candidate adds one term whose gradient reaches the codebook without pulling a transition's two codewords together"
  },
  "equation": "\u4ee4 r_s=s-c_i\uff0cr_t=t-c_j\uff0cd=normalize(t-s)\uff0cn=normalize(r_s-r_t)\uff0c\u5b9a\u4e49 L=weight * mean_mask[softplus(margin - d\u00b7(r_s-r_t)) + separation_weight * relu(min_separation-||c_i-c_j||)^2]\uff0c\u5176\u4e2d i\u3001j \u5206\u522b\u662f source\u3001target \u6700\u8fd1\u7801\u5b57\u3002\u7a7a\u6709\u6548 mask \u65f6 L=0\u3002",
  "expected_failure_modes": [
